# Every action has its own effect: new quest, tracking, abandoning.
Output docs/images/celebrations.gif
Set Height 760
Source docs/demo/settings.tape

Hide
Type "/tmp/qt-seed /tmp/qt-vhs full >/dev/null; clear; ./quest" Enter
Sleep 4.2s
Show

Sleep 600ms
Type "n"
Sleep 500ms
Type "Write the release notes"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "tomorrow 10:00"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2.6s
Type "r"
Sleep 2.4s
Type "d"
Sleep 900ms
Type "y"
Sleep 3.4s
